"Close the bottle's Windows applications. Choose a bottle and destination, select compression, then choose Create Archive. The app verifies the backup before completing it." = "关闭容器中的Windows应用。选择容器、目标文件夹和压缩方式，然后点击创建归档。应用会在完成前验证备份。";
"Fast uses less compression time. Maximum spends more time trying to reduce size. Size estimates use a small sample and may differ from the final archive." = "快速模式减少压缩时间。最大模式花费更多时间来减小文件。估算使用少量样本，可能与最终归档大小不同。";
"In CrossOver, choose Bottle > Import Bottle Archive and select the completed .cxarchive file." = "在CrossOver中选择Bottle > Import Bottle Archive，然后选择已完成的.cxarchive文件。";
"Linked Mac folders are not included. Back up saves and documents stored outside the bottle separately." = "链接的Mac文件夹不包含在内。请单独备份保存在容器外部的存档和文档。";
"Cancel stops this archive job. Existing backups are preserved. If a drive disconnects, an incomplete .partial file may remain; reconnect the drive and remove that incomplete file." = "取消会停止此次归档，现有备份会保留。驱动器断开时可能留下未完成的.partial文件；请重新连接驱动器并删除该未完成文件。";
"Archive contents are processed locally. The app keeps your chosen folders and a small local result record. It does not upload your files." = "归档内容在本地处理。应用保存您选择的文件夹和简短的本地结果记录，不会上传您的文件。";
"Refresh Bottles: Command-R. Create Archive: Return. Cancel: Escape." = "刷新容器：Command-R。创建归档：Return。取消：Escape。";
"Close the applications in this bottle, then try again." = "请关闭此容器中的应用，然后重试。";
"Choose a destination outside the bottle." = "请选择容器外部的目标文件夹。";
"Choose a bottle containing cxbottle.conf." = "请选择包含cxbottle.conf的容器。";
